  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Capacity Building of Bukura Agricultural College Teachers on Digital Pedagogy</narrative>
  </title>
  <description akvo:type="5" type="1" xmlns:akvo="http://akvo.org/iati-activities">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A TMT on adopting ICT and e-learning for delivery of training to the trainers and instructors will enhance the exchange of information and learning between learner-tutor and learner to learner. It will improve quality, accessibility, efficiency, and effectiveness of the training. Capacitating the tutors with the knowledge for delivery training and learning through different ICT and digital platforms will enhance and make available relevant. Training of tutors and use of wide range of tools will provide a suitable platform for teaching &#x2013; learning process, including improving the quality and relevance of training. With the changing dynamics brought about by COVID 19, and the need to adopt to blended and flexible approaches to support distance learning, and the development in ICT will increase the level of interactivity and collaborations amongst learners and tutors.</narrative>
  </description>
